; Stage 16 as-sugar negative fixture: a value-position annotation is CHECKED.
;
; Before the sugar, emit-symbol-ref split `x:NoSuchType` and discarded the type
; half, so this compiled silently and meant `x`. It is now the cast's
; destination, so an unresolvable spelling is a located error. Must FAIL with:
;   "unknown type 'NoSuchType' in the annotation 'x:NoSuchType'"
(defn main ():i32
  (let (x:i32 1)
    (return x:NoSuchType)))
